\section{Latest Physics News}
\subsection{Study finds there may be multiple 'God particles'}
(PhysOrg.com) -- Recent research in the USA suggests there may be \PMlinkexternal{five versions of the theorized Higgs boson}{http://www.physorg.com/news195885620.html}.
This leads to a new \PMlinkexternal{Extended Standard Model of Physics}{http://cdn.physorg.com/newman/gfx/news/tmb/standard_model2_416.gif}
Sanyo announces world's most efficient solar module
Technology / Energy
created 17 hours ago | popularity 4.1 / 5 (15) | comments 21 | with audio podcast report
(PhysOrg.com) -- Sanyo has announced its development of the world's most energy efficient solar module, the HIT-N230. The module was unveiled at a press conference run by Sanyo Electric's Solar Division.
